{"success": true, "data": {"id": 12, "displayOrder": 12, "titleKo": "무신사카피가 가정의 달을 보내는 방법 - ‘천하제일 가족자랑대회’!", "titleEn": "How Musinsa Celebrates Family Month - ‘The World’s Best Family Showdown’!", "titleJa": "無神社が家庭の月を過ごす方法 - 「天下一一家族自慢大会」！", "titleZh": "Musinsa 如何庆祝家庭月——“世界上最好的家庭对决”！", "contentKo": "<div><div style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\">\n<p><em>\n\"우리 엄마 그냥 예.뻐.서 자랑합니다. 예쁘죠~?”‍<br />\n\n“초등학교 3학년때 만나, 올해 '칠순'을 맞이하신 동갑내기 절친 우리 부모님!<br />\n\n“테라스 빌라에서 흙냄새를 맡으며 행복하게 자라나고 있는 6살 무신사카피의 딸을 소개합니다. 건강하게만 자라다오~<br />\n\n“내 새끼라 믿기지 않게 나보다 더 잘난 아들을 우린 춘천까지 운전할 준비가 되어 있어.나머지는 피플팀에 맡길게.”</em></p></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>어린이날과 어버이날을 앞둔 5월의 어느 날, 무신사카피 슬랙 채널이 가족자랑글로 가득 찼습니다. 예쁜 우리 엄마 자랑, 부모님의 러브 스토리, 사랑스런 무신사카피의 딸, 나머지는 피플팀에게 맡긴다는 귀여운 협박(?) 메시지까지. 치열했던 가족자랑 대결, 무신사카피 ‘천하제일 가족자랑대회’의 현장으로 여러분을 초대 합니다!</p><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>우리 엄빠, 아들딸랑구를 자랑해 주세요!</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>무신사카피 피플의 가족 사랑은 ‘무신사카피랑해’라는 무신사카피의 메시지 만큼이나 유명합니다. 매달 무신사카피에서 10만원씩 자유롭게 쓸 수 있는 셀럽비 지원으로 가족 선물을 사는 것부터 가족 건강검진, 숙박 제휴 등 다양한 방법으로 사랑을 표현해 왔으니까요.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>이런 무신사카피 피플이라면 분명 어린이날과 어버이날을 앞두고 “올해는 어떻게 사랑할까?” 고민이 많았겠죠? 그래서 무신사카피 피플을 생각하는 PEOPLE팀이 나섰습니다. 이름하야, 무신사카피 천하제일 가족자랑대회! </p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_0.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>천하제일 가족자랑대회는 우리 가족을 자랑하는 사연을 슬랙 스레드로 남기면 그 중 6분을 선정해 선물을 증정하는 특별한 이벤트입니다. 선물로는 레스토랑 식사권, 춘천에 오픈한 따끈한 테마파크 자유이용권, 고오급 화장품 선물, 그리고 아이들의 천국인 장난감 스토어 상품권 등 가족과 함께 할 수 있는 다양한 상품으로 준비됐습니다. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>그렇다면 무신사카피 피플은 과연 어떤 자랑 사연을 보내 주었을까요?</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_1.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_2.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>피플팀은 무수한 가족자랑의 손길에 감동을 받아 참여해 주신 모든 피플 여러분의 이야기를 엽서로 만들어 자택으로 보내 드렸습니다. 앞으로도 사랑하는 가족들과 함께 지금처럼 늘 행복하시길 바라는 마음과 함께, 그 행복에 무신사카피가 함께 하고 싶다는 바람을 담았습니다. 그리고 감동적이라는 피플 여러분의 이야기에 덩달아 행복해졌던 이벤트였습니다.</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_3.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_4.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>가족 자랑에도 진심인 무신사카피 피플</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>사실 이렇게 자랑글이 많을 줄은 상상하지 못했습니다. 참여가 적으면 어쩌나 걱정도 했지만, 모두 기우에 불과했죠! 가족을 소개하고 자랑하는 데에도 진심인 무신사카피 피플. 왜 이리도 자랑에 진심일까 고민해 봤는데요. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>무신사카피는 자랑 DNA가 스며들어 있는 곳입니다. 무진장 신발 사진이 많았던 커뮤니티 시절부터 2,300만 개에 달하는 후기, 개인의 스타일링을 공유하고 자랑하는 ‘스냅’ 서비스에 이르기까지 무신사카피의 곳곳에는 자랑의 공간이 많죠. </p><p>&zwj;</p><p> ‘천하제일 가족자랑대회’로 무척이나 무신사카피스러운가정의 달을 보낸 무신사카피! 앞으로도 무신사카피에서 받는 사랑이 우리 가족들에게도 이어지길 바라면서, 우리 가족도 다 무신사카피랑 해~ S2</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_content_5.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p></div>", "contentEn": "<div><div style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\">\n<p><em>\"My mom is just so pretty, I'm proud of her. Isn't she pretty~?\"<br />\n\n“My parents, my best friends and friends of the same age who met in third grade and are celebrating their 70th birthday this year!<br />\n\n\"Introducing the six-year-old daughter of a gentleman, who is growing up happily in a terraced villa, smelling the earth. I hope she grows up healthy and healthy.<br />\n\n\"I can't believe he's my son. He's so much more talented than I am. We're ready to drive him to Chuncheon. I'll leave the rest to the People Team.\"</em></p></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>One day in May, just before Children's Day and Parents' Day, the Musinsa Slack channel was filled with family bragging posts. They included boasts about their beautiful moms, love stories between parents, a lovely Musinsa daughter, and even a cute threatening(?) message to leave the rest to the People Team. We invite you to the intense family bragging competition, the Musinsa \"World's Best Family Brag Contest!\"</p><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>Dad, please show off your son and daughter!</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa People's love for their families is as famous as the company's message, \"I love Musinsa.\" They've expressed their love in various ways, from purchasing family gifts with the 100,000 won Celebrity Fee they can freely spend at Musinsa each month, to sponsoring family health checkups and accommodation partnerships.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>If you're one of these gentlemen, you've probably been wondering, \"How should I love this year?\" with Children's Day and Parents' Day approaching. That's why the PEOPLE team, dedicated to gentlemen, has stepped forward. It's called the \"Musinsa World's Best Family Showdown!\"</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d6e8e0a66411ca120f5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%841%20(1).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>The World's Best Family Showdown is a special event where six family members will be selected to receive gifts from Slack threads filled with stories of their families showing off their talents. Prizes include restaurant vouchers, free admission to a newly opened theme park in Chuncheon, high-end cosmetics, and gift certificates to a kid-friendly toy store.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>So, what kind of proud stories did the Musinsa people send us?</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987bf17d400690b8714fd5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987cae08d0725fc047726a_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(4).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>The People Team was so moved by the countless acts of family pride that we sent postcards to the homes of all the people who participated, sharing their stories. We expressed our hope that you will continue to be as happy as you are now with your beloved families, and that Musinsa will be a part of that happiness. And it was an event that brought us joy, thanks to the touching stories of the people who participated.</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987c4cc1ee92e134166a9d_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(3).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d9ae9d4d18183526a8c_%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>Musinsa People, who are sincere even when bragging about their family</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>Honestly, I never imagined there would be this many boasts. I was worried there wouldn't be much participation, but my worries were unfounded! Musinsa people are so genuine in introducing and bragging about their families. I've been wondering why they're so genuine in their boasting.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa is a place steeped in pride. From its community days brimming with shoe photos to its 23 million reviews and its \"Snap\" service, where people can share and show off their personal styling, Musinsa is filled with moments of pride.</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa had a truly wonderful Family Month with the \"World's Best Family Pride Contest!\" We hope the love we receive from Musinsa will continue to extend to our family, and our entire family loves Musinsa too~ S2</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/628761127302ff48901b6d13_%EA%B0%95%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p></div>", "contentJa": "<div><div style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\">\n<p><em>\n「私たちのお母さんはただはい。<br />\n\n「小学校3年生の時に会い、今年「七순」を迎えた同い年の親しい親！<br />\n\n「テラスヴィラで土の匂いを嗅いで幸せに成長している6歳の無神社の娘を紹介します。元気にだけ育ちましょう〜<br />\n\n「私の子だと信じられないように、私よりも良くなった息子を私たちの春川まで運転する準備ができている。残りはピープルチームに任せる」</em></p></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>こどもの日と母の日を控えた5月のある日、無神社スラックチャンネルが家族の誇りに満ちていました。きれいな私の母親自慢、両親のラブストーリー、愛らしい無神社の娘、残りはピープルチームに任せるというかわいい脅迫（？）メッセージまで。激しい家族自慢対決、無神社「天下一一家族自慢大会」の現場に皆さんを招待します！</p><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>私たちのお母さん、息子の娘と自慢してください！</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>無神社ピープルの家族愛は「無神愛」という無神社のメッセージほど有名です。毎月無神社で10万ウォンずつ自由に使えるセレブ費支援で家族プレゼントを買うことから家族健康検診、宿泊連携など様々な方法で愛を表現してきたからです。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>こういう無神社ピープルなら、きっとこどもの日と母の日を控えて「今年はどう愛するか？」悩みが多かったでしょう？それで、無神社の人々を考えるPEOPLEチームが出ました。名前は、無神社天下第一家族自慢大会！ </p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d6e8e0a66411ca120f5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%841%20(1).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>天下一一家族自慢大会は、私たちの家族を誇る事情をスラックスレッドとして残すとそのうち6分を選定してプレゼントを贈呈する特別なイベントです。贈り物としては、レストランの食事券、春川にオープンした暖かいテーマパークの自由利用券、高五級化粧品の贈り物、そして子供たちの天国のおもちゃストアの商品券など、家族と一緒にできる様々な商品が用意されています。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>それでは、無神社ピープルは果たしてどんな自慢の事情を送ってくれたのでしょうか？</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987bf17d400690b8714fd5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987cae08d0725fc047726a_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(4).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>ピープルチームは無数の家族自慢の手に感動を受けて参加してくださったすべてのピープルの皆さんの物語をポストカードにして自宅に送りました。これからも愛する家族と一緒に今のようにいつも幸せになることを願う心と共に、その幸せに無神社が一緒にしたいという風を込めました。そして感動的というピープルの皆さんのお話にとても幸せになったイベントでした。</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987c4cc1ee92e134166a9d_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(3).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d9ae9d4d18183526a8c_%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>家族自慢にも本気である無神社ピープル</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>実際、このように誇りが多いとは想像できませんでした。参加が少なかったら、とにかく心配もしましたが、みんな気にすぎませんでした！家族を紹介して自慢するのにも心からの無神社ピープル。なぜこれも自慢に心からなのか悩んでみました。 </p><p>&zwj;</p><p>無神社は自慢のDNAが染み込んでいるところです。無尽蔵の靴の写真が多かったコミュニティ時代から2,300万個に達する後期、個人のスタイリングを共有して誇る「スナップ」サービスに至るまで、無神社のあちこちには自慢の空間が多いです。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p> 「天下一一家族自慢大会」ですごく無思慮な家庭の月を送った無神社！これからも無神社で受ける愛が私たちの家族にもつながりたいと願いながら、私たちの家族もみな無神愛して～ S2</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/628761127302ff48901b6d13_%EA%B0%95%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p></div>", "contentZh": "<div><div style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\">\n<p><em>“我妈妈真漂亮，我为她感到骄傲。她是不是很漂亮呢~？”<br />\n\n“我的父母、我的挚友，还有我从三年级就认识的同龄朋友，他们今年都庆祝70岁生日了！”<br />\n\n“向大家介绍一位绅士的六岁女儿，她住在排屋别墅里，快乐地成长，呼吸着泥土的芬芳。我希望她健康快乐地长大。”<br />\n\n“我简直不敢相信他是我的儿子。他比我更有天赋。我们已经准备好开车送他去春川了。剩下的就交给人民团队吧。”</em></p></div><p>&zwj;</p><p>五月的某一天，就在儿童节和父母节前夕，Musinsa 的 Slack 频道里全是炫耀家庭的帖子。内容包括赞美美丽的妈妈、父母之间的爱情故事、可爱的 Musinsa 女儿，甚至还有一条略带威胁（？）意味的信息，说剩下的就交给人事团队吧。我们诚邀您参加这场激烈的家庭炫耀大赛——Musinsa “世界最佳家庭炫耀大赛”！</p><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>爸爸，请带你儿子和女儿出去炫耀一下吧！</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa 员工对家人的爱与公司口号“我爱 Musinsa”一样闻名遐迩。他们以各种方式表达爱意，例如用每月可在 Musinsa 自由支配的 10 万韩元明星酬劳购买家庭礼物，赞助家庭健康检查和住宿合作。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>如果你也是这些男士中的一员，随着儿童节和父母节的临近，你可能一直在思考：“今年我该如何表达爱意呢？” 正因如此，致力于服务男士的《人物》杂志团队推出了一项名为“穆辛萨世界最佳家庭对决”的活动！</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d6e8e0a66411ca120f5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%841%20(1).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>“世界最佳家庭对决”是一项特别活动，届时将选出六位家庭成员，他们将通过Slack聊天群中展示的家庭才艺故事获得奖品。奖品包括餐厅代金券、春川新开业主题公园的免费门票、高端化妆品以及儿童玩具店的礼品券。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>那么，穆辛萨人民给我们带来了哪些令人自豪的故事呢？</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987bf17d400690b8714fd5_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987cae08d0725fc047726a_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(4).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><p>人民团队被无数展现家庭自豪感的举动深深感动，我们给所有参与者寄送了明信片，分享他们的故事。我们衷心希望你们能继续与挚爱的家人保持这份幸福，也希望穆辛萨能成为这份幸福的一部分。感谢所有参与者的感人故事，这次活动也给我们带来了无比的喜悦。</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987c4cc1ee92e134166a9d_%EC%82%AC%EC%A7%842(3).jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/62987d9ae9d4d18183526a8c_%EB%B8%94%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><h3 style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600\"><strong>穆辛萨人，即使在吹嘘自己的家族时也十分真诚。</strong></h3><p>&zwj;</p><p>说实话，我真没想到会有这么多人炫耀。我之前还担心参与的人不多，结果证明我的担心是多余的！穆辛萨人介绍和炫耀自己家人的时候真是太真诚了。我一直在想，他们为什么这么真诚地炫耀呢？</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa是一个充满自豪感的地方。从社区日里满是鞋子的照片，到2300万条评论，再到人们可以分享和展示个人风格的“Snap”服务，Musinsa处处都洋溢着自豪感。</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>Musinsa 度过了一个精彩纷呈的家庭月，参加了“世界最佳家庭自豪感大赛”！我们希望 Musinsa 带给我们的爱能够继续传递给我们的家人，我们全家也都非常爱 Musinsa~ S2</p><p>&zwj;</p><p>&zwj;</p><figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\"><div><img src=\"https://uploads-ssl.webflow.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/628761127302ff48901b6d13_%EA%B0%95%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p></div>", "thumbnailUrl": "https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/team_musinsa_12_thumbnail.jpg", "linkUrl": null, "linkTarget": null, "publishedAt": "2022-05-31T00:00:00.000Z", "date": "2022.05.31", "visibleKo": true, "visibleEn": false, "visibleJa": false, "visibleZh": false, "hashtagsKo": [{"id": 1, "name": "팀무신사카피"}], "hashtagsEn": [], "hashtagsJa": [], "hashtagsZh": []}}